        "cinderfall": {
            "incomplete": "The +2 apex item bonus to Strength and Constitution has no confirmed rule-element hook: real pf2e 'apex' items (Mask of Allure, Angelic Opera Cloak) grant FlatModifier item bonuses to specific skills tied to an ability, never to the raw ability score -- apex is a first-class Automatic Bonus Progression character-build attribute (system.build.attributes.apex, src/module/actor/character/data.ts:188,343), not something a generic item's rules set. Using both new Strikes as a single action, and the once-a-week forced-target rider, also have no hook: nothing reduces the action cost of two of an item's own granted Strikes together, and nothing lets a held item override the player's choice of attack target.",
